OL,3,W"###"###"###T///////,-.,,/,,.-,,///////
OL,4,CNvidia value climbs by almost $1tn and 
OL,5,Ctech stocks rally after Jensen Huang   
OL,6,Creturns                                
OL,7,GNvidia's market value rose by nearly   
OL,8,G$1 trillion as its share price         
OL,9,Gskyrocketed after the tech firm        
OL,10,Greinstated Jensen Huang as its chief   
OL,11,Gexecutive with immediate effect.       
OL,13,FHis shock reinstatement comes less     
OL,14,Fthan two weeks after Huang resigned    
OL,15,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman 
OL,16,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy, a 
OL,17,Fperiod in which shares in the          
OL,18,Fchipmaker have also fallen             
OL,19,Fsignificantly.                         
OL,22,                                   G3/8 
