OL,4,CGTA 6 hacker released on licence with  
OL,5,Cwarning 'don't let this happen again'  
OL,6,GA cyber criminal who hacked the maker  
OL,7,Gof Grand Theft Auto has been released  
OL,8,Gon licence on the same day as being    
OL,9,Gsentenced to 7 years in prison.        
OL,11,FMultiple offender Arion Kurtaj, from   
OL,12,FOxford, was released from custody with 
OL,13,Fthe judge warning him: "Don't let this 
OL,14,Fhappen again."                         
OL,16,FThe now 21-year-old hacked several     
OL,17,Fcompanies and individuals, including   
OL,18,FGTA 6-maker Rockstar Games, whom he    
OL,19,Ftried to extort after stealing clips   
OL,20,Fof the unfinished game in 2022.        
OL,22,                                   G4/8 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
